	)
	(text "OUT 1 / OUT 2: DAC1_OUT1 (PA4) / DAC1_OUT2 (PA5) -> 1k/4.7n (34 kHz step smoothing) -> TL074 x3.4 - 2.4 x VOFF\n(buffered DAC 0.2..3.1 V -> +/-4.9 V), 1k 0.5 W to the jack. DC coupled: audio, CV or LFO."
